        "original_id": "7ce38c4e-3812-587c-b69d-b0a93f120991",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mychal Thompson\n- Organizations: San Antonio Spurs, Golden State Warriors, University of Minnesota, Portland Trail Blazers, Los Angeles Lakers, Boston Celtics, Chicago Bulls\n- Places: San Antonio, AT&T Center\n- Roles: Power forward, Center\n- Topics: NBA championships\n\nFacts:\n- Mychal Thompson played the power forward and center positions for the University of Minnesota, the Portland Trail Blazers, the San Antonio Spurs, and the Los Angeles Lakers.\n- The San Antonio Spurs play their home games at the AT&T Center in San Antonio.\n- The Golden State Warriors have won five NBA championships.\n- The San Antonio Spurs also have five NBA championships, which is tied for fourth-most in NBA history.\n- The Boston Celtics have 17 NBA championships, the Los Angeles Lakers have 16, and the Chicago Bulls have 6, all ahead of the Golden State Warriors and the San Antonio Spurs.",
